      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a Black woman, likely a public figure, being interviewed while overlaid with the text 'i support terrorists because they're pea brains like me.' This text is a hateful and racist trope that uses an anti-Black stereotype (comparing intelligence to 'pea brains') to dehumanize and insult a specific racial group. The meme's intent is to attack the individual and her community by invoking a harmful racial stereotype, implying that her intelligence or moral character is so low that she would support terrorism. This is a direct attack based on race, fitting the definition of hateful content. The juxtaposition of the image of a poised, professional Black woman with the derogatory text creates a jarring and offensive contrast meant to provoke outrage or ridicule, but ultimately serves to demean and dehumanize.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
